The tail is the connection gap, not auth's own work: auth server spans stay at ~75 ms, and the one 281 ms outlier matches its client span exactly. I have enough to answer.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-user-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "WITH c AS (SELECT trace_id, span_id, CAST(time AS TIMESTAMP) ct, duration cd FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-user-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name='POST'), s AS (SELECT trace_id, parent_span_id, CAST(time AS TIMESTAMP) st, duration sd FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-auth-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name='POST /api/v1/auth') SELECT count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(epoch_ms(s.st)-epoch_ms(c.ct),0.5),1) gap_p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(epoch_ms(s.st)-epoch_ms(c.ct),0.95),1) gap_p95_ms, round(approx_quantile(s.sd/1e6,0.95),1) auth_server_p95_ms FROM c JOIN s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id",
          "claim": "Before ts-auth receives POST /api/v1/auth from ts-user-service, the gap reaches ~645 ms at p95, while auth's own server span stays ~75 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5),1) p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-user-service' AND span_name IN ('POST','UserController.registerUser','POST /api/v1/userservice/users/register') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "ts-user-service register path is slow at p95 (~700 ms) while its DB child spans stay sub-millisecond, so the time is in the outbound POST."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-user-service",
      "to": "ts-admin-user-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5),1) p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND span_name IN ('POST /api/v1/adminuserservice/users','AdminUserController.addUser') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "ts-admin-user-service POST /users server p95 rises to ~300 ms because it waits on the slow ts-user-service register call."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-admin-user-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5),1) p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name='POST /api/v1/adminuserservice/users' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard POST /api/v1/adminuserservice/users p95 rises to ~719 ms, the user-visible symptom, versus ~90 ms normal."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
